  "placement": "Book page 86, topic 3.8 (example): how we walk. Next to চিত্র ৩.১২ (a person's foot pushing the ground back, the ground pushing the person forward, labelled F and −F).",
  "order": 1,
  "maintainers": ["RadeenXALNW"],
  "units": "m",
  "description": "Live 3D walking lesson for Newton’s third law (topic 3.8, page 86), set in a school yard. A fully articulated student pushes off while an enlarged live view of the same shoe shows equal opposite forces on the ground and the person. Firm ground, loose sand and a slippery floor change grip, forward motion and backward slip. A scrubbable slowed timeline and pause control let students inspect the simultaneous force pair. Live force accounting gives a = F/m for the person; an illustrated explanation separates the two receiving bodies and explains static friction and why the pair does not cancel. The existing five scene-based questions remain. Horizontal forces only; a simplified initial push-off with example numbers, offline in Bangla and English.",
  "tags": ["force", "newtons-laws", "third-law", "action-reaction", "walking", "friction", "bangla"],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "lang",
      "label": "Language",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [["bn", "বাংলা"], ["en", "English"]],
      "default": "bn"
    },
    {
      "name": "ground",
      "label": "Ground",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [["hard", "firm ground"], ["sand", "loose sand"], ["slip", "slippery floor"]],
      "default": "hard"
    },
    {
      "name": "at",
      "label": "Start at",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "rest",
      "placeholder": "rest | hold | s",
      "help": "rest: standing; hold: stopped at the telling moment (both forces shown); or seconds (0 to 2.4) into the slowed-down push-off"
    },
    {
      "name": "tried",
      "label": "Grounds already found",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "",
      "placeholder": "hard,sand",
      "help": "their pushes show under the words"
    },
    { "name": "view", "label": "View", "type": "select", "options": ["front", "3d"], "default": "front" },
    {
